; The ONE variable: whether a Node2D whose CanvasItem chain is BROKEN still
; inherits the transform above the break. `get_global_transform` composes
; through `get_parent_item()`, which casts only the direct parent
; (canvas_item.cpp:565-571), so a plain `Node` link makes the node a canvas root
; drawing in canvas space. No Control fixture can see the Node2D world walk at
; all, and the flag form of the same break is `unit-node2d-top-level.tscn`.
; The attached sibling holds the inherited position beside it.

